 "por el movimiento: con x = d, $ {dx}/{dt} = v$, $ {dΦ}/{dt} = {μ_0 N I h}/{2π} (1/{d + w} − 1/d) v = −{μ_0 N I h w v}/{2π d (d + w)}$ = ${f(Math.abs(I) * k * v * (1 / (d + w) - 1 / d))} Wb/s": "",
